  "title": "UBX: Fix encoding parameter for 32-bit flags field",
  "description": "Summary:\n\nIn ubx_nav_relposned, proto_tree_add_bitmask() used ENC_NA for hf_ubx_nav_relposned_flags (registered as FT_UINT32). Multi-byte bitmask fields must specify endianness.\n\nChanges:\n\n\\- Changed ENC_NA to ENC_LITTLE_ENDIAN.\n\n\\- Resolves warning from tools/check_typed_item_calls.py.",
