      "title": "UBX: Fix encoding parameter for 32-bit flags field",
      "message": "UBX: Fix encoding parameter for 32-bit flags field\n\nIn ubx_nav_relposned, proto_tree_add_bitmask() was called with ENC_NA for hf_ubx_nav_relposned_flags, which is registered as FT_UINT32. Multi-byte bitmask fields must specify endianness.\n\nChange ENC_NA to ENC_LITTLE_ENDIAN to match the protocol specification and fix the warning from check_typed_item_calls.py.",
      "author_name": "meel-ayush",
      "author_email": "ayushmeel.dev@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2026-09-08T15:45:52.000+00:00",
